    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">不用</div>
        <div class="col">bú yòng</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Example</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">猫<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">想</span>喝牛奶</div>
    <div>māo xiǎng hē niúnǎi</div>
    <div>The cat would like to drink the milk</div>
</div>
